<Base title="Build with apps you own" description="Get your environment ready, choose useful mini-apps, and let your coding agent build software you own. Configure independent apps and connect their data."><section class="hero"><div><h1>Build with <br/><span>apps you own.</span></h1><p class="lede">Connect a photo guestbook to a curated collection. Configure the result, then let your agent handle the build and deployment.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/ready">Get ready to build <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="/demo">See the apps working together</a></div><p class="note"><a href="/ready/guide">First time? Start with the step-by-step guide.</a></p><p class="note">Explore the apps and save a draft. Your own agent handles execution.</p></div><figure class="hero-art generated-hero"><img src="/brand/share-ai-v1.jpg" alt="App Composer’s orange and charcoal square frames joined together, on a warm ivory field." width="1200" height="630" fetchpriority="high"/><figcaption>Independent pieces, composed into software you own.</figcaption></figure></section><section class="section split"><div><h2>Collect a photo. Give it a place.</h2><p class="lede">Leave a moment in Here / there. Approve it, feature it in Top shelf, then open the original. Hide the source and the feature disappears.</p><a class="button" href="/demo">Open the live composition</a><p class="note">Each app keeps its own GitHub source and data.</p></div><div class="demo-images"><figure><a href="/guestbook"><img src="/brand/courtyard-ai-v1.jpg" alt="Generated fictional courtyard with warm terracotta walls and a green chair" width="1200" height="630"/></a><figcaption>Here / there · Photo Guestbook</figcaption></figure><figure><a href="/showcase"><img src="/brand/coastal-path-ai-v1.jpg" alt="Generated fictional coastal steps and tree shadows beside a calm sea" width="1200" height="800"/></a><figcaption>Top shelf · Curated Showcase</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class="section"><h2>Choose your next step.</h2><div class="route-row"><h3>No idea yet?</h3><p>Your coding agent checks your actual workspace, GitHub and Cloudflare, then deploys a small HTTPS reference. Real proof comes before a project brief.</p><a href="/ready">Get Ready</a></div><div class="route-row"><h3>Ready to make?</h3><p>Choose apps and configure the parts that matter. Export a portable spec and hand it to Codex in the environment you already verified.</p><a href="/init">Start Init</a></div><div class="route-row"><h3>Still deciding?</h3><p>Compare directions, change your mind and save a decision path. Exploration does not purchase, deploy or change your account.</p><a href="/explore">Explore decisions</a></div></section><section class="section split"><div><h2>Keep your source and customisations.</h2><p>Each app keeps its source history and current privacy state. Configuration stays separate from upstream code. A failed update leaves the working version in place.</p><a href="/docs">Read the ownership and update model</a></div><div class="ink"><h3>You set the direction.</h3><p class="lede">Your agent prepares the environment, builds the app and checks the deployment. You keep the final say.</p><p>Authentication, purchases and consequential approvals still belong to you. The agent handles routine technical decisions.</p></div></section></Base>
